        "top_url": "",
        "top_button_style": "button",
        "body": "<p>Every OEM project starts with understanding the brand, target market and design direction behind the collection. References, sketches, product ideas and commercial requirements are reviewed together so the development path is clear before sampling begins.</p><p>This early stage establishes the design intent and gives both sides a shared foundation for the work ahead.</p>",
