        "subtitle_preset": "h5",
        "top_url": "",
        "top_button_style": "button",
        "body": "<p>Material choices are reviewed against the intended design, positioning and finishing direction of the collection. Depending on the project, this may include sterling silver, brass, gold directions, stones, pearls and other decorative elements.</p><p>The focus is on selecting combinations that support both the visual result and the practical requirements of the finished piece.</p>",
